that person will dance.

458
00:22:51,967 --> 00:22:53,967
That way, we can get to know
the Baby Dolls better.

459
00:22:53,967 --> 00:22:55,767
First entry.

460
00:22:55,767 --> 00:23:00,167
Who among you often
