I often cut classes.

476
00:23:38,967 --> 00:23:40,767
Well, that was in high school.

477
00:23:40,767 --> 00:23:43,267
But did you get good grades
in grade school?

478
00:23:43,267 --> 00:23:46,267
No. I was always listed among
the talkative students.

479
00:23:46,267 --> 00:23:47,267
- [LAUGHTER]
- [SILLY SFX PLAYS]

480
00:23:47,267 --> 00:23:49,267
You know, the list
of noisy students.

481
00:23:49,267 --> 00:23:51,467
