1044
00:46:20,600 --> 00:46:21,633
It's not like that!

1045
00:46:21,633 --> 00:46:23,067
- It's my dream--
- That's hard, right?

1046
00:46:23,067 --> 00:46:25,967
You like to be alone,
but you'll join a group?

1047
00:46:25,967 --> 00:46:27,100
What's wrong with you?

1048
00:46:27,100 --> 00:46:29,500
It is my dream to be in a group.

1049
00:46:29,500 --> 00:46:32,300
But I'm very...

1050
00:46:32,300 --> 00:46:34,700
When I want to have
my alone time,

1051
00:46:34,700 --> 00:46:37,400
I really want to be
in my own space.

1052
00:46:37,400 --> 00:46:39,333
Because it's hard when
you're introverted

1053
00:46:39,333 --> 00:46:40,800
but you joined a choir group.

1054
00:46:42,133 --> 00:46:43,833
Then you joined
in the group outing.

1055
00:46:44,433 --> 00:46:46,500
You're first on the lis
during field trip

1056
00:46:46,500 --> 00:46:48,200
but you're introverted.

1057
00:46:48,267 --> 00:46:54,967
At first, I don't really
approach them.

1058
00:46:54,967 --> 00:46:58,100
But since I've been influenced
by their craziness,

1059
00:46:58,100 --> 00:47:00,233
I'm now part of the noisy ones.

1060
00:47:00,233 --> 00:47:01,233
- Ah, really?
- Yes.

1061
00:47:01,233 --> 00:47:03,200
Do you like this?
You really want to--

1062
00:47:03,200 --> 00:47:05,167
You joined in the dance segment,
<i> Girl on Fire,</i>   right?

1063
00:47:05,167 --> 00:47:07,500
- Yes, <i> Girl on Fire.
</i>-Did you reach the grand finals?

1064
00:47:07,500 --> 00:47:10,933
I didn't. I auditioned
for the wild card

1065
00:47:10,933 --> 00:47:12,167
but I didn't make it.

1066
00:47:12,167 --> 00:47:14,333
Do you really want
to be a dancer?

1067
00:47:14,333 --> 00:47:19,067
It's my dream. Because
growing up, I loved K-pop.

1068
00:47:19,100 --> 00:47:23,367
And I always thought that
I'd be a K-pop artist someday

1069
00:47:23,433 --> 00:47:25,733
or even be a part
of a girl group.

1070
00:47:25,733 --> 00:47:27,600
I thought before that
I won't reach that dream

1071
00:47:27,600 --> 00:47:28,733
because my parents
disagree with that.

1072
00:47:28,733 --> 00:47:31,000
And it's hard to be
a K-pop artist

1073
00:47:31,000 --> 00:47:33,300
If you're not Korean and
you're not going to Korea.

1074
00:47:33,633 --> 00:47:35,400
I don't have a passport yet!

1075
00:47:35,400 --> 00:47:37,033
How will you be a K-pop artist

1076
00:47:37,033 --> 00:47:39,900
If you're not Korean and
you're not going to Korea?

1077
00:47:39,900 --> 00:47:41,067
You're in the Philippines and

1078
00:47:41,067 --> 00:47:42,300
you're dreaming of being
a K-pop artist?

1079
00:47:42,300 --> 00:47:43,533
Ambitious!

1080
00:47:44,233 --> 00:47:45,833
You didn't even enter P-pop!

1081
00:47:45,833 --> 00:47:47,067
You went straight to K-pop.

1082
00:47:47,067 --> 00:47:49,367
Even though you
didn't go to Korea

1083
00:47:49,367 --> 00:47:51,867
and you didn't become
a K-pop artist,

1084
00:47:51,900 --> 00:47:54,467
- you're a P-pop artist now.
- Yes.

1085
00:47:55,233 --> 00:47:56,933
It's just the same.

1086
00:47:56,933 --> 00:48:00,933
K-pop just has a wider reach,
but who knows, in time...

1087
00:48:00,933 --> 00:48:02,667
But I'm happy with Baby Dolls.

1088
00:48:02,667 --> 00:48:04,033
Yes.

1089
00:48:04,033 --> 00:48:07,400
Ina, you have done
a lot with your life.

1090
00:48:07,400 --> 00:48:08,367
- Yes.
- Yes.

1091
00:48:08,367 --> 00:48:11,033
She's into sports.
What sports do you play?

1092
00:48:11,033 --> 00:48:12,533
When I was two years old,

1093
00:48:12,533 --> 00:48:15,267
my mother enrolled me
in a ballet workshop.

1094
00:48:15,267 --> 00:48:17,967
Enrolled at two years old?
Oh my gosh!

1095
00:48:17,967 --> 00:48:18,967
While you, you're in second year

1096
00:48:18,967 --> 00:48:20,800
and you didn't attend any class!

1097
00:48:20,800 --> 00:48:22,733
- Ballet class?
- Yes.

1098
00:48:22,733 --> 00:48:25,733
- Someone rented it to us.
- Are you rich?

1099
00:48:26,833 --> 00:48:29,100
Because ballet, I don't know
nowadays

1100
00:48:29,100 --> 00:48:31,200
because during our time,

1101
00:48:31,200 --> 00:48:34,000
only the rich ones
are going to ballet classes,

1102
00:48:34,000 --> 00:48:36,033
karate and taekwondo classes.

1103
00:48:36,033 --> 00:48:38,900
- [TETAY] Piano.
- Piano lessons.

1104
00:48:38,900 --> 00:48:41,867
Right? If you're not well-off,

1105
00:48:41,867 --> 00:48:43,767
during the summer break,

1106
00:48:43,767 --> 00:48:44,933
-[VERNA] You play hit the can.
- you play hopscotch,

1107
00:48:44,933 --> 00:48:47,800
hit the can or join the
basketball league.

1108
00:48:47,800 --> 00:48:50,000
Or you'll sell banana cue.

1109
00:48:50,000 --> 00:48:52,000
But you don't have
classes like that.

1110
00:48:52,000 --> 00:48:55,067
Unless you're part
of a MILO event.

1111
00:48:55,067 --> 00:48:57,200
So your family is well-off?

1112
00:48:57,233 --> 00:48:59,267
I guess.

1113
00:48:59,267 --> 00:49:03,200
I really wasn't able to identify
before is we're rich or poor.

1114
00:49:03,200 --> 00:49:06,300
- Why?
- My mom is a school owner.

1115
00:49:06,300 --> 00:49:07,700
- But our house--
- You're rich!

1116
00:49:07,700 --> 00:49:09,667
- You own a school!
- Wait!

1117
00:49:09,667 --> 00:49:12,600
But our house was just

1118
00:49:12,600 --> 00:49:15,133
