1119
00:49:15,133 --> 00:49:17,567
- Huh?
- Pig pen.

1120
00:49:18,033 --> 00:49:19,767
The pen...

1121
00:49:19,767 --> 00:49:22,767
Because my parents
got separated.

1122
00:49:22,767 --> 00:49:26,167
My mom became
a single parent.

1123
00:49:26,167 --> 00:49:29,533
Her mom gifted her a school.

1124
00:49:29,533 --> 00:49:31,467
My mother's family
was wealthy,

1125
00:49:31,500 --> 00:49:33,633
but she chose to be independent.

1126
00:49:33,633 --> 00:49:34,733
- Ah.
- Then...

1127
00:49:34,733 --> 00:49:36,400
And so she started with...

1128
00:49:36,400 --> 00:49:38,500
She lived in a pig pen at first.

1129
00:49:38,500 --> 00:49:40,433
- Until...
- Yes.

1130
00:49:40,433 --> 00:49:42,300
She established her own life.

1131
00:49:42,300 --> 00:49:45,367
Yes. Eventually, our life has
become comfortable.

1132
00:49:45,367 --> 00:49:48,500
- She didn't--
- Did you live with a pig?

1133
00:49:48,500 --> 00:49:52,533
No. It was a pig pen before.

1134
00:49:52,533 --> 00:49:54,500
What other things
have you done in the past?

1135
00:49:54,500 --> 00:49:59,467
Oh, swimming. I have been
a swimmer for three years.

1136
00:49:59,467 --> 00:50:02,100
And then I started
playing badminton.

1137
00:50:02,100 --> 00:50:04,867
And then, I gave up
on volleyball,

1138
00:50:04,900 --> 00:50:07,167
I only played
for about three months.

1139
00:50:07,467 --> 00:50:09,600
Then, I became interested
in basketball

1140
00:50:09,600 --> 00:50:11,133
because of my brothers.

1141
00:50:11,600 --> 00:50:14,567
Then I also competed
in the local town games,

1142
00:50:14,567 --> 00:50:15,533
in track and field.

1143
00:50:15,533 --> 00:50:16,500
[VICE] Ohh.

1144
00:50:16,900 --> 00:50:19,700
- Swimming, dancing,
- [AUDIENCE LAUGHS]

1145
00:50:19,700 --> 00:50:22,567
ballet, track and field,
and badminton.

1146
00:50:22,567 --> 00:50:25,367
- That's why you're so thin now.
- [SILLY SFX PLAYING]

1147
00:50:25,367 --> 00:50:27,833
You must have been
so tired as a kid, huh?

1148
00:50:27,833 --> 00:50:30,033
My mom kept enrolling me

1149
00:50:30,033 --> 00:50:33,300
