with my friends.

1150
00:50:33,300 --> 00:50:35,400
That's what your parents
didn't do.

1151
00:50:35,400 --> 00:50:37,100
- [LAUGHTER]
- [SILLY SFX PLAYING]

1152
00:50:37,133 --> 00:50:38,700
They didn't enroll you
in those kinds of activities,

1153
00:50:38,700 --> 00:50:40,900
- so you kept going out.
- Exactly.

1154
00:50:40,900 --> 00:50:42,600
[JOHAIRA] But we didn't--
We didn't have the budget.

1155
00:50:42,600 --> 00:50:44,400
- They owned a school.
- [LAUGHING SFX]

1156
00:50:44,400 --> 00:50:47,000
We only owned
farmland and estates,

1157
00:50:47,000 --> 00:50:48,900
- things like that.
- [LAUGHTER]

1158
00:50:48,900 --> 00:50:50,133
I'm just kidding.
[UNINTELLIGIBLE]

1159
00:50:50,133 --> 00:50:51,400
[JOHAIRA LAUGHS]

1160
00:50:51,400 --> 00:50:53,400
[VICE LAUGHS] Fancy.

1161
00:50:53,400 --> 00:50:56,367
How hard was it waiting
to have your moment?

1162
00:50:56,367 --> 00:50:57,367
How hard was it?

1163
00:50:57,633 --> 00:51:00,600
For me, Meme...
I'm about to cry. Can I cry?

1164
00:51:00,600 --> 00:51:01,800
- Mhm.
- Okay.

1165
00:51:01,800 --> 00:51:03,933
[JOHAIRA] No,
because at that time,

1166
00:51:03,933 --> 00:51:06,100
I was the breadwinner
of our family.

1167
00:51:06,100 --> 00:51:07,033
So...

1168
00:51:07,033 --> 00:51:09,467
- [AUDIENCE EXCLAIMS]
- [JOHAIRA CRIES]

1169
00:51:09,467 --> 00:51:10,667
Vince, I need you.

1170
00:51:10,700 --> 00:51:11,867
[LAUGHTER]

1171
00:51:11,867 --> 00:51:13,700
- No, seriously...
- And then he just ignored you.

1172
00:51:13,700 --> 00:51:16,033
- [JOHAIRA LAUGHS]
- She said, "Vince, I need you."

1173
00:51:16,033 --> 00:51:17,167
[VICE] And Vince
just ignored her.

1174
00:51:17,167 --> 00:51:18,500
- [LAUGHS] No, seriously now.
- Okay.

1175
00:51:18,500 --> 00:51:20,333
[VICE] At that time, you were
the breadwinner of the family.

1176
00:51:20,333 --> 00:51:22,100
- Actually-- Until now.
- Until now.

1177
00:51:22,100 --> 00:51:23,900
[VICE] But that time,
[STAMMERS]

1178
00:51:23,900 --> 00:51:25,233
why was it so hard

1179
00:51:25,233 --> 00:51:26,700
- waiting for that moment?
- It was so hard because

1180
00:51:26,700 --> 00:51:28,067
my mom didn't have a job,

1181
00:51:28,067 --> 00:51:30,233
