1182
00:51:30,233 --> 00:51:32,500
- [MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]
- I also had younger siblings.

1183
00:51:32,500 --> 00:51:33,733
So, I was the one providing
for them,

1184
00:51:33,733 --> 00:51:34,933
