1185
00:51:34,933 --> 00:51:36,300
[INHALES HEAVILY]

1186
00:51:36,300 --> 00:51:38,167
The money really wasn't enough.

1187
00:51:38,167 --> 00:51:39,633
And I'm sorry,
but I'll just say it.

1188
00:51:39,633 --> 00:51:41,133
My salary really wasn't enough.

1189
00:51:41,500 --> 00:51:43,500
I kept telling the Lord,

1190
00:51:44,400 --> 00:51:47,600
[SNIFFLES] "You gave me
an opportunity."

1191
00:51:47,600 --> 00:51:51,267
I said, "But why does it feel
like nothing is happening?"

1192
00:51:51,267 --> 00:51:53,133
I called my mom
and told her,

1193
00:51:53,133 --> 00:51:54,633
"Mom, I'm going home."
[INHALES SHARPLY]

1194
00:51:54,633 --> 00:51:57,133
I'd rather just stay there,
because at least...

1195
00:51:57,400 --> 00:51:58,900
I was with my family.

1196
00:51:58,900 --> 00:52:01,433
Then, I talked to my mom.
I said...

1197
00:52:01,433 --> 00:52:03,667
My mom has always
been very supportive.

1198
00:52:03,667 --> 00:52:07,400
She told me-- I don't know
if she was just saying this,

1199
00:52:07,400 --> 00:52:09,533
but she said
she had a dream that

1200
00:52:09,533 --> 00:52:12,167
