our group.

1201
00:52:12,167 --> 00:52:13,467
And she always tells me,

1202
00:52:13,467 --> 00:52:16,467
"Okay, keep going.
Because if you leave,

1203
00:52:16,500 --> 00:52:19,033
you'll never know
if this will lead to anything."

1204
00:52:19,033 --> 00:52:20,333
Then I said,

